{"id":"5977d540cf66c60d","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction.md","title":"自然性质给出的伪随机函数区分器","display":"thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction — 自然性质给出的伪随机函数区分器","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction","aliases":["28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction"],"display":"thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction — 自然性质给出的伪随机函数区分器","depends_on":["[[28-df-natural-property]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"503–504","source_pdf_pages":"529–530"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction — 自然性质给出的伪随机函数区分器"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c85902878b27217\" href=\"?note=4c85902878b27217\" title=\"28-df-natural-property\">28-df-natural-property</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"503–504"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"529–530"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,s,\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{Natural}\">\\(P,s,\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{Natural}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c85902878b27217\" href=\"?note=4c85902878b27217\" title=\"28-df-natural-property\">28-df-natural-property</a>，假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)\">\\(\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_n\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(K_n\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为有限密钥集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n:K_n\\to\\mathcal B_n\">\\(F_n:K_n\\to\\mathcal B_n\\)</span>；对所有充分大 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 及所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in K_n\">\\(k\\in K_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_n(k)\">\\(F_n(k)\\)</span> 有至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\">\\(s(n)\\)</span> 门的有界扇入电路。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n\">\\(\\mathcal B_n\\)</span> 上均匀随机函数；密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_n\">\\(K_n\\)</span> 上独立均匀选取，所有概率使用这些明确的有限均匀分布。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists n_0\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\left|\\Pr_{f\\sim U_n}[P_n(f)=1]-\\Pr_{k\\sim U(K_n)}[P_n(F_n(k))=1]\\right|\\ge\\frac1n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists n_0\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\left|\\Pr_{f\\sim U_n}[P_n(f)=1]-\\Pr_{k\\sim U(K_n)}[P_n(F_n(k))=1]\\right|\\ge\\frac1n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：usefulness 使第二概率为0，largeness 使第一概率至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/n\">\\(1/n\\)</span>；constructiveness 则使这个测试在真值表长度的多项式时间内完成。它是自然证明屏障的直接区分器核心，未省略参数地宣称普通多项式安全 PRF 就排除所有自然性质。原书完整 Theorem 23.1 还经亚指数安全 OWF 到相应 PRF 的参数转换；此轮只形式化本项可直接闭合的机制。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.3，印刷 pp.503–504 / PDF pp.529–530；本项为其中显式有限概率推导。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-natural-property","status":"resolved","id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-natural-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-natural-property","status":"resolved","id":"4c85902878b27217","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,s,\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{Natural}$ 来自 [[28-df-natural-property]]，假设 $\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)$。\n$K_n\\ne\\varnothing$ 为有限密钥集，$F_n:K_n\\to\\mathcal B_n$；对所有充分大 $n$ 及所有 $k\\in K_n$，$F_n(k)$ 有至多 $s(n)$ 门的有界扇入电路。\n$U_n$ 为 $\\mathcal B_n$ 上均匀随机函数；密钥 $k$ 在 $K_n$ 上独立均匀选取，所有概率使用这些明确的有限均匀分布。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,s,\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{Natural}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Natural}(P,s)","display":false},{"tex":"K_n\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"F_n:K_n\\to\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in K_n","display":false},{"tex":"F_n(k)","display":false},{"tex":"s(n)","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"K_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists n_0\\;\\forall n\\ge n_0\\;\\left|\\Pr_{f\\sim U_n}[P_n(f)=1]-\\Pr_{k\\sim U(K_n)}[P_n(F_n(k))=1]\\right|\\ge\\frac1n.","display":true},{"tex":"1/n","display":false}],"bytes":1800,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第23章：自然证明障碍：[[28-df-natural-property]]、[[28-thm-natural-property-prf-obstruction]]。"}],"outgoing":["4c85902878b27217"]}